WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.720
Integration contracts
preserve replaceability.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.120
Intake defines the task,
scope, context and deadline.

00:00:07.246 --> 00:00:12.080
Action requests carry identity,
schema and authorization context.

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:17.240
Runners publish artifact hashes,
configuration and original results.

00:00:17.302 --> 00:00:20.800
Evaluation supplies scenario
evidence to a named release owner.

00:00:20.933 --> 00:00:25.760
Exercise missing scope, malformed
requests, mismatched artifacts

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:30.240
and stale evidence. A compatible
adapter is useful only if its failure

00:00:30.284 --> 00:00:34.320
behavior preserves the contract as
well as its successful response.
